# PROJECT CONTEXT: Festival of Blessings Community (FOBC)

## Project Overview
FOBC is a mobile-first social application built for the Festival of Blessings (FOB 2026), an international Christian event organized by Gospel of Christ Ministries under Dr. Shawn & Dr. Annie Smith. 

The app functions as a distraction-free "Instagram for the Church Community" during and after the 3-day November event. It connects believers from Cameroon and around the world, driving continuous engagement through daily selfie/media contests, realtime chat, music-infused posts, and long-term community networking.

## Primary Business & Technical Logic
1. *Top Blessing Leaderboard (Day 1-3 Contest):* 
   - A sticky, real-time "Top Blessing" card automatically pins the highest-engaged post (calculated dynamically via likes + comments) to the very top of the feed.
   - At midnight on each event day, a snapshot saves the daily winner to the "Hall of Blessings".
2. *Email Authentication:* Account setup via email and password, with a confirmation link, so the community can be tested and used without an SMS provider.
3. *Media Posts & Music Integration:* Users post photos/videos, write captions, and attach gospel audio tracks/snippets.
4. *Community Features:* Direct Messaging (1-on-1 Realtime Chat), Likes, Comments, Follow/Unfollow, and WhatsApp deep-link sharing.
5. *Post-Event Continuity:* Holds full social app functionality after the 3-day event to keep the church ecosystem connected year-round.

## Tech Stack
- *Frontend:* Next.js 14+ (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Framer Motion
- *Backend/Database:* Supabase (PostgreSQL, Supabase Auth with email and password, Storage Buckets, Realtime Engine)
- *Deployment:* Netlify + GitHub CI/CD

## Development Rules for Cursor
- *Automated Execution:* Execute all necessary shell and terminal commands directly via the integrated terminal. Do NOT ask the user to run manual commands unless terminal access is restricted.
- *Mobile-First UI/UX:* Design with a sleek mobile viewport layout (centered app shell for desktop screens), high-contrast modern typography, and smooth micro-interactions.
- *Brand Theme:* Royal, modern, and spiritual tones. Primary colors: Deep Royal Indigo/Navy (#0F172A), Radiant Gold (#F59E0B), and Clean White (#FFFFFF).
- *Data Integrity:* Strict Row Level Security (RLS) on all Supabase tables.